flowchart TD
    A([evaluateDecisionReadiness\ncalled]) --> B[Check 1: checkPhotosProcessed\nphoto count and quality\nABSENT or UNKNOWN status\nWARN not FAIL per ARCH-02]

    A --> C[Check 2: checkIncidentConfirmed\nincident type classification\nconfidence threshold\ncanonicaliseIncidentType]

    A --> D[Check 3: checkPhysicsValid\nphysics engine ran\nspeed plausibility\nforce and energy bounds]

    A --> E[Check 4: checkCostAvailable\nquote or AI estimate\npresent and non-zero\ncurrency resolved]

    B --> F[buildBlockingIssues\ncollect FAIL status checks\ninto BlockingIssue list]
    C --> F
    D --> F
    E --> F

    F --> G[computeConfidence\nweighted check scores\npenalty for WARN\nzero for FAIL]

    G --> H[buildSummary\nhuman-readable\nreadiness summary]

    H --> I{Any FAIL\nchecks?}
    I -- Yes --> J[ready = false\nblocking issues present]
    I -- No --> K[ready = true\nall checks PASS or WARN]

    J --> L([return DecisionReadinessResult\nready, confidence\nblockingIssues, checks\nsummary])
    K --> L

    style A fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32
    style L fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32
